\item date: 20/01/89\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo\\
Added mu6,mu7. Added vp021.
\item date: 13/09/89\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo\\
Excluded perspro's from this rule as they are always deleted.
\item date: 18/09/89\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo\\
Added mu9 (and mu1 in m!) and conditions on mu1 and mu9.
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] To introduce in a passive construction with a definite object
a subjrel/PRONPVAR with the record of the object. The object remains in 
object-position.
